  "description": "Promptuarium is a versatile, tree-based data structure to store or exchange data and metadata efficiently (in binary format). Written in pure C#, can be used in F#, too.",
  "id": "Promptuarium",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-31T09:35:38.35Z",
