  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New: Promptuarium.Serializer, a separate, experimental package (opt-in PRMTSER000): .NET objects to trees and back, without JSON, in the layout of SERIALIZER_FORMAT.md (PRMT:GEN1-LE, PRMT:CFG1-LE or a signature of the application), with comments. pedit and PStudio show the metadata before the data. PStudio: only the forms that give a content back byte for byte are offered; the tags and the type codes of the serializer layout by name; the chosen forms are remembered for every file (View / Reset Types forgets them); File / Open Recent; the settings are kept. GetStatistics().ToString() lists the metadata lines first. The library API and the binary format are unchanged.",
